    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: [date]</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container narrow prose" aria-label="Terms text">
    <p>[Have these terms reviewed by a lawyer before publishing. Text in square brackets needs your details.]</p>
    <p>These terms apply to your use of the website at upperkai.com, run by Upperkai Ventures ("Upperkai", "we", "us"). By using the website you agree to them. Each Upperkai product has its own terms, which apply when you use that product.</p>

