    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of [country or state], and the courts of [jurisdiction] have jurisdiction over any dispute.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Upperkai Ventures, [registered address]. Email: <a href="mailto:hello@upperkai.com">hello@upperkai.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
